{"id":"magen","lemma":"Magen","pos":"noun","rank":1920,"glosses":["stomach, maw"],"ipa":"/ˈmaːɡən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/61/De-Magen.ogg/De-Magen.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Magens","plural":"Mägen"},"examples":[{"text":"Macht dir dein Magen immer noch Probleme?","en":"Is your stomach still bothering you?","words":[{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"your"},null,null,null,{"g":"problem","l":"Problem"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"still"]]},{"text":"Liebe geht durch den Magen.","en":"The way to a man's heart is through his stomach.","words":[{"g":"lovable","l":"lieb"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"by means of"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Ich kann deinen Magen knurren hören.","en":"I can hear your stomach growling.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"to growl"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)"}]},{"text":"Die Augen sind größer als der Magen.","en":"The eye is bigger than the belly.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"eye","l":"Auge"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"big","l":"groß"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Mein Magen knurrt.","en":"My stomach is grumbling.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to growl","l":"knurren"}]}]}